{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "embedding_lookup",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "input",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.int64",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, seq_len]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[num_embeddings, embedding_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.embedding(x)；对输入索引张量，从权重 weight 中按索引查表，输出 float32 张量。",
        "输入索引必须非负且小于 num_embeddings。",
        "输出形状为 [batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]，排列顺序与输入一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "l2_normalize",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "epsilon",
          "kind": "float",
          "dtype": null,
          "device": null,
          "shape": null,
          "layout": null,
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": true,
          "default": 1e-09
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = x * torch.rsqrt(torch.sum(x**2, dim=-1, keepdim=True) + 1e-9)。",
        "对输入张量 x，在最后一维计算每个向量的 L2 范数平方 sum(x*x)，加上 epsilon 后计算 rsqrt，再逐元素乘以 x。",
        "输出形状与输入相同。",
        "默认 epsilon 为 1e-9。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.embedding(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对输入 int64 索引张量执行 Embedding 查表，输出 float32 张量。",
        "输出形状为 [batch_size, seq_len, embedding_dim]。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = x * torch.rsqrt(torch.sum(x ** 2, dim=-1, keepdim=True) + 1e-09)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 step_001 输出在最后一维计算平方和（保持维度），加 1e-9 后取 rsqrt，再与原始张量逐元素相乘。",
        "输出形状与输入相同。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回 step_002 的归一化结果。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}